    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14728" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραχν-ιώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
